---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact FilePebble — Support, bugs and feature requests" description="Contact the FilePebble maintainer through the public GitHub project. Get help with file tools, report a bug, or suggest a feature.">
  <article class="prose-page wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">LET’S MAKE IT MORE USEFUL</div>
    <h1>A question?<br />A better idea?</h1>
    <p>FilePebble is an independent project maintained by Adhi, the developer behind <a href="https://github.com/AdhiAR437">AdhiAR437 on GitHub</a>. The official website is <a href="https://filepebble.com/">filepebble.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Support and feature requests</h2>
    <p>Our current contact channel is the public GitHub project. Use its Issues tab to ask a question, report a problem or suggest a tool. A GitHub account is needed to post. There is no support email or contact form in this release.</p>
    <p><a class="primary-link" href="https://github.com/AdhiAR437/FileNest">Visit the GitHub project <span>↗</span></a></p>
    <h2>What helps us investigate</h2>
    <ul><li>The tool name and the steps that led to the problem.</li><li>Your browser name and version, and whether you used a phone or computer.</li><li>The error message, with personal details removed.</li><li>A small, invented example that reproduces the issue, if you can create one.</li></ul>
    <p>GitHub issues are public. Do not post private documents, passwords, API keys, payment details or personal information. We do not need your original sensitive files to troubleshoot a tool. For a sensitive concern, request a private contact channel without posting the details.</p>
    <h2>Before you report a problem</h2>
    <p>Each tool includes instructions and supported-file limits. Scanned PDFs need OCR, which is not available yet. Image comparison needs equal dimensions. Password-protected PDFs and PDFs with interactive forms or signatures are not supported.</p>
    <p>Read <a href="/privacy/">how local processing works</a> or check the <a href="/about/">current tools and roadmap</a>. Support is handled as the maintainer’s time allows; we do not promise a response time.</p>
  </article>
  <style>.prose-page a:not(.primary-link){text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.prose-page .primary-link{color:white}</style>
</Layout>
